<view class="screen {{skinClass}}" data-skin="{{skin.id}}">
  <view class="screen-head compact-head"><view><view class="eyebrow">我的缓冲区</view><view class="page-title">外观与数据</view></view><view class="skin-badge">{{skin.shortName}}</view></view>
  <view class="scene-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="我的视图"><button wx:for="{{scenes}}" wx:key="id" class="scene-tab {{item.active ? 'active' : ''}}" data-index="{{item.index}}" bindtap="selectScene">{{item.label}}</button></view>
  <swiper class="scene-deck" current="{{activeSceneIndex}}" bindchange="changeScene" duration="180">
    <swiper-item><view class="scene-slide"><view class="scene-heading"><view><view class="section-title">六套皮肤</view><view class="muted">每套都是一个完整视觉世界</view></view><view class="scene-index">01</view></view><scroll-view class="skin-scroll" scroll-x="true" show-scrollbar="false" enhanced="true"><view class="skin-row"><button wx:for="{{skins}}" wx:key="id" class="skin-option option-{{item.id}} {{item.selected ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-skin="{{item.id}}" bindtap="selectSkin"><image class="skin-thumb" src="{{item.artwork}}" mode="aspectFill" aria-hidden="true" /><view class="skin-option-copy"><view class="skin-option-name">{{item.name}}</view><view class="skin-option-desc">{{item.description}}</view></view><view class="selected-mark" wx:if="{{item.selected}}">正在使用</view></button></view></scroll-view><view class="scene-footnote">左右拖动皮肤卡，选择后四个入口会一起变化</view></view></swiper-item>
    <swiper-item><view class="scene-slide"><view class="scene-heading"><view><view class="section-title">本机数据</view><view class="muted">默认只留在当前微信</view></view><view class="scene-index">02</view></view><view class="surface data-vault"><view class="vault-status"><view class="vault-dot"></view><view><view class="vault-title">{{dataStatus}}</view><view class="muted">{{confirmedLabel}}</view></view></view><view class="vault-count"><text class="number">{{changeCount}}</text><text> 条变化记录</text></view><view class="divider"></view><button class="primary vault-action" bindtap="exportBackup">导出备份</button><button class="secondary vault-action" bindtap="importBackup">从剪贴板导入</button><view class="backup-note">导入前会先显示摘要，未经确认不会替换当前数据。</view></view></view></swiper-item>
    <swiper-item><view class="scene-slide"><view class="scene-heading"><view><view class="section-title">数据与产品边界</view><view class="muted">五条清楚说明</view></view><view class="scene-index">03</view></view><view class="surface boundary-panel"><view class="boundary-item"><text>01</text><view>只整理你亲自确认的现实数字，不补全未知信息。</view></view><view class="boundary-item"><text>02</text><view>不接银行账户，不把可能收入计入可用现金。</view></view><view class="boundary-item"><text>03</text><view>当前不声称官网与小程序实时同步。</view></view><view class="boundary-item"><text>04</text><view>官网的复杂自然语言解析会把当前原句和必要摘要发送到模型服务；小程序当前仍使用本地整理。两端都要本人确认后才写入 Reality。</view></view><view class="boundary-item"><text>05</text><view>提供现实整理，不构成投资、医疗、心理或法律建议。</view></view></view><button class="quiet-danger clear-action" bindtap="clearData">清空当前微信里的数据</button></view></swiper-item>
  </swiper>
</view>
